{"confidence": 0.68, "created_at": "2026-10-14T12:41:58.946958+00:00", "event_id": null, "evidence_end_char": 78, "evidence_quote": "但是他和明鏡的和平先生和明鏡這個關係 他是跟我害我有沒有關係 沒關係", "evidence_start_char": 44, "extraction_method": "qwen2.5-7b-instruct-4bit-grounded-keypoints-v2-variable", "extraction_status": "machine", "id": "KPT_LIVE_20180207_002_SEG_000001_002", "importance": 0.7, "point_index": 2, "point_text": "陈军和明镜的关系并不直接。", "point_type": "argument", "segment_id": "LIVE_20180207_002_SEG_000001", "significance": "强调了陈军与明镜之间的关系并非直接。", "supporting_claim_id": null, "topic_id": "TOPIC_DISCLOSURE_INVESTIGATION"}
